(footprint "FlexTail_1x06_P0.5mm"
	(version 20260206)
	(generator "stackup")
	(descr "The end of a flexible circuit that plugs into a 6-position 0.5 mm FPC connector: six gold fingers, 0.3 mm wide and 3.5 mm long on a 0.5 mm pitch, on a 4.0 mm wide tail. Mask opened over the fingers, no paste. The stiffener goes on the far side of the fingers, bringing the tail to 0.3 mm; the fingers face the connector's contacts, which on a Hirose FH12-xxS-0.5SH are on the bottom. Pad 1 is at the left with the fingers facing you and the tail pointing away.")
